  "rulesText": "There are ten Domains, each comprising a collection of cards granting features or special abilities expressing a particular theme. Please note the Daggerheart Core Set includes only the following nine domains: Arcana, Blade, Bone, Codex, Grace, Midnight, Sage, Splendor, and Valor.",
